Preserve accrued fee splits with pending payout balances (#87)

- Allocate fees to scaled admin/protocol balances before attempting transfers; retain failed payouts for retry.
  - Use trySafeTransfer in the pool and propagate accounting errors directly through the factory.
  - Add a pending-fee reader and separate collection tests from swap fee-accrual tests using a storage-write harness.